OL,5,G0300 Dear Henry: Our Fight for Justice
OL,6,G     - A Tonight Special
OL,7,     FThe 2025 murder of 18-year-old
OL,8,     FHenry Nowak shocked millions after
OL,9,     Ffootage of his final moments came
OL,10,     Fto light at the trial of his
OL,11,     Fattacker in June this year. In an
OL,12,     Finterview with Paul Brand, Henry's
OL,13,     Ffamily share memories of a
OL,14,     Fmuch-loved son and brother, while
OL,15,     Fasking questions about the
OL,16,     Ftreatment he received, and the
OL,17,     Fpolice investigation that followed
